==**Part one — why it is popular among customers.** ICAI's sentence: **'The popularity which virtual banking services have won among customers is due to the speed, convenience and round the clock access they offer.'** Expand each in a clause:==
**Speed** — instructions take effect without the delay of branch processing;
**Convenience** — the service is reached from wherever the customer is, so **customers are 'increasingly moving away from the confines of traditional branch banking'**;
**Round the clock access** — the service is not bounded by banking hours.

